# Non-secret variables only. Copy to .env and keep that file local.
# Do not put real organization, user, alias, group, federation or key values in git.
#
# Secrets and the organization id are not listed here and must not be written into .env.
# Export them in the process environment before running the CLI:
#   Y360_TOKEN
#   Y360_ORG_ID
#
# Leave Y360_API_BASE empty to keep each method on its documented host.
# Set it only to point this process at a local stand-in.

Y360_API_BASE=
